  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4c3123130db224d45a77cee047322601, type: 3}
  m_Name: Cutscene Dialog
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b90acb33a755d494cafdd1d36518e58b, type: 2}
    textENG: ...What just happened? Did the train stop?
    textPL: "...Co si\u0119 w\u0142a\u015Bnie sta\u0142o? Czy poci\u0105g si\u0119
      zatrzyma\u0142?"
    expressionName: surprised
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21e4c61027200ed4cb69b6c975342017, type: 2}
    textENG: Attention passengers. Due to unforeseen technical issues, this train
      will not continue its journey.
    textPL: "Uwaga pasa\u017Cerowie. Z powodu nieprzewidzianych problem\xF3w technicznych,
      poci\u0105g nie b\u0119dzie kontynuowa\u0142 swojej podr\xF3\u017Cy."
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21e4c61027200ed4cb69b6c975342017, type: 2}
    textENG: We kindly ask all passengers to disembark at the next stop.
    textPL: "Prosimy wszystkich pasa\u017Cer\xF3w o opuszczenie sk\u0142adu na najbli\u017Cszej
      stacji."
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21e4c61027200ed4cb69b6c975342017, type: 2}
    textENG: We apologize for the inconvenience, and thank you for your understanding.
    textPL: "Przepraszamy za niedogodno\u015Bci i dzi\u0119kujemy za wyrozumia\u0142o\u015B\u0107."
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b90acb33a755d494cafdd1d36518e58b, type: 2}
    textENG: Alright... I guess I better get off this train.
    textPL: "No dobrze... Chyba lepiej b\u0119dzie opu\u015Bci\u0107 ten poci\u0105g."
    expressionName: sad
